; ReBeep patch. Edit it in ReBeep Studio or by hand.
; OPn= AR DR SL RR OL KSL MULT WAVE TREM VIB SUS KSR, decimal.
; SL and OL: bigger is louder. OCTAVE 4 is the game's pitch.
; The tire squeal and the gear chirp: a rough screech, not a bell. The
; modulator at the pitch with full feedback, for grit; the carrier an
; octave up, both with vibrato and no decay. A short release bridges
; the engine's 40 ms between squeal slots without ringing on after.
[PATCH]
FORMAT=1
OCTAVE=4

[2OP]
; CONNECTION: FM or AM. FEEDBACK 0..7.
CONNECTION=FM
FEEDBACK=7
OP1=15 0 15 7 36 0 1 0 0 1 1 0
OP2=15 0 15 7 56 0 2 0 0 1 1 0
